# Held-out classes per LICENSING-MANIFEST.md — the WORKING SYSTEM deliberately
# does not track these at the workspace root. Patterns are anchored to this
# workspace root so future legitimate paths (for example docs/reference/ or a
# docs/HANDOFF.md) stay trackable. The preservation capture's copies of the
# same classes ARE tracked (owner ruling 2026-07-24, "Commit all 39" — see the
# re-includes at the bottom); the capture tier in git history is the re-obtain
# path.

# Re-include the reference components' AUTHORED declaration files: the root
# .gitignore ignores **/*.d.ts as build output, but these four are hand-written
# prop documentation from the design studio, not generated artefacts.
!components/**/*.d.ts

# Same re-include for the MCP-137 preservation capture (byte-preserved copies
# of the same four authored .d.ts files; caught by the S0 check-ignore pass —
# a silently-unstaged capture file would violate zero-loss by omission).
!studio-source/original-capture-2026-07-23/components/**/*.d.ts

# Class 15 — studio provenance (screenshots, brand toolkit PDF, note sources,
# Figma dump, oak-components theme extracts)
/uploads/
/reference/

# Class 16 — studio infrastructure (generated bundles, thumbnails, compiler
# output, and the studio's own session/handoff surfaces). `.thumbnail` stays
# unanchored deliberately: every level's .thumbnail is a studio-generated
# preview artefact (templates/*/.thumbnail included).
/_ds_bundle.js
/_ds_manifest.json
/_adherence.oxlintrc.json
.thumbnail
/thumbnail.html
/support.js
/SKILL.md
/HANDOFF.md
/CLAUDE-CODE-HANDOFF.md
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT ignored (MCP-160, 2026-07-25): the owner-ruled
# disposition reclassified it from studio session surface to the studio's
# normative instruction — this package holds the repo canonical, which ships
# by direct write each sync (.design-sync/estate.json §directWrites).

# MCP-137 owner ruling (2026-07-24, "Commit all 39"): the capture tier's
# held-out-class copies are committed byte-preserved. Re-include the
# capture-nested thumbnails that the unanchored `.thumbnail` above would
# otherwise silently unstage (the only three of the 39 any ignore pattern
# reached — verified by `git check-ignore` over all 39 destination paths).
!studio-source/original-capture-2026-07-23/.thumbnail
!studio-source/original-capture-2026-07-23/templates/lesson-deck/.thumbnail
!studio-source/original-capture-2026-07-23/templates/worksheet/.thumbnail
